      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191603745.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191603745.png" 
             alt="" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p><strong>BUUCTF: <a href="https://buuoj.cn/challenges"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://buuoj.cn/challenges</a></strong></p>
<hr>
<p>相关阅读
<a href="https://ctf-wiki.org/"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CTF Wiki</a>
<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/mochu7777777/article/details/109671882"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BUUCTF：[MRCTF2020]Unravel!!</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191605778.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191605778.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<p>得到的 flag 请包上 flag{} 提交。
感谢天璇战队供题。</p>
<h3 id="密文">密文：</h3>
<p>下载附件，解压得到Unravel文件夹，文件如下：</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191607940.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191607940.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<hr>
<h3 id="解题思路">解题思路：</h3>
<p>1、先看Look_at_the_file_ending.wav文件，既然已经提示我们看文件结尾，就用010Editor打开，得到一串密文。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">key</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">U2FsdGVkX1</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">nSQN</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="n">hoHL8OwV9iJB</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">mSdKk5dmusulz4</span><span class="o">=</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191609317.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191609317.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>密文有点像Base64，尝试Base64解密，发现“ <code>Salted</code> ”头部，判断为AES加密，寻找密钥。</p>
<p><a href="https://www.qqxiuzi.cn/bianma/base64.htm"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Base64编码转换</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191611066.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191611066.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>2、接下来处理JM.png，在StegSolve看到“ <code>PK</code> ”头，存在隐藏ZIP压缩包。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191612856.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191612856.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>用010 Editor打开，将压缩包的数据，提取保存为ZIP文件。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191615583.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191615583.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>解压得到aes.png文件，这应该就是AES的密钥。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">Tokyo</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191617747.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191617747.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>3、进行AES解密，得到win-win.zip的解压密码： <code>CCGandGulu</code> 。</p>
<p><a href="https://www.sojson.com/encrypt_aes.html"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在线AES加密/解密</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191618884.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191618884.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>解压win-win.zip，得到Ending.wav。这里要使用SilentEye进行解密，下载地址： <a href="https://achorein.github.io/silenteye/"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://achorein.github.io/silenteye/</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191622063.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228191622063.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>得到flag： <code>MRCTF{Th1s_is_the_3nd1n9}</code></p>
<h3 id="flag">flag：</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">flag<span class="o">{</span>Th1s_is_the_3nd1n9<span class="o">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div>]]></content:encoded>
